{"type":"Film","id":"HR2022_011","slug":"hr2022-011-sigurno-mjesto","title":{"native":"Sigurno mjesto","english":"Safe Place"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2022-11-03","year":2022},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Juraj Lerotić","slug":"juraj-lerotic","name":"Juraj Lerotić","birthYear":1978,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Croatia","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt21230074/mediaviewer/rm3389458177/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/video/vi1131529497/?playlistId=tt21230074&ref_=tt_ov_pr_ov_vi"},"synopsis":{"native":"Traumatski događaj – iznenadni pokušaj suicida – otvara procijep u svakodnevnom životu tročlane obitelji. Njihov život se mijenja iz temelja, kao da su uvučeni u rat nevidljiv svima ostalima. Radnja je reducirana na ono najakutnije, kratak vremenski period i situaciju koja se svodi na najvažnije – spasiti bližnjega. Film se temelji na osobnom iskustvu autora koji ujedno igra i glavnu ulogu.","english":"Nine-year-old Roman follows his mother Oksana to Germany where she is working illegally. She is living there with the 62-year-old widower Gert who suffers from diabetes. Gert tries to make friends with the boy, but Roman struggles for his mother's attention. When Oksana suddenly falls ill, Roman is left alone with his rival. Gert turns out to be a good playmate until he dies in an accident. Roman is all alone and can now live out his wild curiosity and longing for freedom."},"production":[{"country":"Croatia","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Darko Plovanić","slug":"darko-plovanic","name":"Darko Plovanić","birthYear":1963,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Croatia","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Igor Samobor","slug":"igor-samobor","name":"Igor Samobor","birthYear":1957,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Croatia","awards":[]},"rol